  ↓
Tables
  ↓
Data
```

---

### 🎤 Interview Answer

> An RDBMS is software used to manage relational databases. It provides features such as SQL querying, transactions, relationships, constraints, and data integrity. PostgreSQL is an example of an RDBMS.

