FROM students;
```

Filtering:

```sql
SELECT *
FROM students
WHERE age >= 18;
```

Joining:

```sql
SELECT students.name, courses.course_name
FROM students
JOIN courses
ON students.course_id = courses.id;
```

SQL is one of the most important skills you'll develop in this lesson.

---

### 🎤 Interview Answer

> PostgreSQL provides strong support for SQL, allowing developers to create, query, update, and manage relational data using a standardized database language.

