# 🧠 Complete SQL Workflow

You've now learned the basic CRUD workflow.

```text
                 PostgreSQL
                     │
                     ▼
                  TABLE
                     │
       ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
       │             │             │
       ▼             ▼             ▼
     INSERT        SELECT        UPDATE
       │             │             │
       │          WHERE            │
       │             │             │
       └─────────────┼─────────────┘
                     │
                   DELETE
                     │
                ORDER BY
                     │
                  LIMIT
```

The four major CRUD operations are:

```text
C → CREATE / INSERT
R → READ / SELECT
U → UPDATE
D → DELETE
```

