## 🎤 Interview Answer

> Python can communicate with PostgreSQL through a database driver such as psycopg. SQLAlchemy can provide SQL toolkit and ORM capabilities on top of the database driver. I should understand SQL even when using an ORM because the ORM ultimately interacts with the database through SQL.

