# 🔐 Professional Security Mindset

Since you're also learning cybersecurity, start developing these habits now.

## ❌ Don't do this

```python
password = "MyDatabasePassword123"
```

Don't commit credentials.

---

## ❌ Don't use superuser for your application

Avoid:

```text
FastAPI
   ↓
postgres superuser
```

Prefer:

```text
FastAPI
   ↓
app_user
   ↓
Only required privileges
```

---

## ❌ Don't blindly run

```sql
DELETE FROM students;
```

or:

```sql
UPDATE students
SET grade = 0;
```

without understanding the impact.

---

## ❌ Don't create indexes everywhere

Indexes have costs.

---

## ❌ Don't expose unnecessary database fields

For example, don't return sensitive fields simply because:

```sql
SELECT *
```

retrieves them.

